== Acceptance criteria ==

Wave 12 is ready to leave Phase 3 when:

# all 30 reader surfaces remain present;
# one concept = one Core semantic identity;
# reproducible-workflow normalization remains intact;
# seven Bioinformatics requests are satisfied with canonical links;
# controlled Domains pass;
# genetics/genomics, sequence/annotation, alignment/homology and gene-tree/species-tree boundaries remain explicit;
# reproducible computation remains distinct from reproducibility/replication;
# derivatives remain category/identity-exempt;
# complete V2 release gates and staging pass.

